            "review_title": "Review at Tà Tà Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Tà Tà K\n10 contributions\n0\nA hidden gem in Tân Bình, near Tan Son Nhat airport - Must Try\nApr 2025 • Family\nWe stumbled upon Tà Tà Kitchen by chance and it turned out to be the best surprise of our trip! The vibe is chill but thoughtful—like visiting a friend who happens to be an amazing chef. The sea bass with herb salad and cherry tomatoes was incredibly fresh, and the skin had that perfect crunch. Loved the cheeky posters and quotes on the wall—makes you smile before the food even arrives.\n\nStaff were super friendly, and the wine pairing was on point. You can tell this place is run with passion. Definitely bookmarking this for every time we're back in Saigon!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\ni think it's better to book a table before heading to here, since it often full in the weekend.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 19, 2025",
